            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1136/thx.45.4.287" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-sage-300 no-underline mt-1 hover:underline">DOI: 10.1136/thx.45.4.287 ↗</a>
          </div>
